{"ts":"2026-07-31T06:28:24.061Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"66076e2c28cfb4fafc6fb839","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vcs-wm40"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Phase 3: distribution over a real transport"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Bundles let two repositories exchange history offline, which is enough to prove the object model but is not distribution. This phase adds named remotes, remote-tracking refs, and clone, fetch and push over a transport, with object negotiation computed from reachability rather than sending the whole store, and non-fast-forward pushes refused by default."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Epic"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-31T06:28:24.061Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-31T06:28:24.061Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm vcs clone produces a repository whose object closure and refs are identical to the source; fetch transfers only objects the receiver lacks; push refuses a non-fast-forward without an explicit override and never leaves a ref pointing at an object that was not transferred; remote-tracking refs live under refs/remotes and are never confused with local branches"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"d51439a9fafaa65da1ede4983ff270bb1aa906af85c0f4fe39b57c6004780f77","message":""}
